msgstr ""
"**注意：** PyTorch 和 NumPy 的精确版本在 `requirements/requirements.txt` 中固定。Kaiwu SDK"
" v1.3.1 是当前推荐版本。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:26
msgid "Check the Python version:"
msgstr "检查 Python 版本："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:33
msgid ""
"If you need to install Python 3.10, please visit the <u>Python 3.10 download"
" page</u>."
msgstr "如果需要安装 Python 3.10，请访问 <u>Python 3.10 下载页面</u>。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:35
msgid "Install Kaiwu-PyTorch-Plugin"
msgstr "安装 Kaiwu-PyTorch-Plugin"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:37
msgid ""
"You can choose either local setup (conda/pip) or Docker setup (recommended "
"for reproducibility and isolation)."
msgstr "您可以选择本地安装（conda/pip）或 Docker 安装（推荐用于可复现性和隔离性）。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:38
msgid "Option 1: Local Setup (conda/pip)"
msgstr "方案一：本地安装（conda/pip）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:40
msgid "Step-by-Step Guide"
msgstr "分步指南"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:42
msgid ""
"**Create and Activate Environment** It is recommended to use conda to create"
" an isolated Python environment:"
msgstr "**创建并激活环境** 推荐使用 conda 创建独立的 Python 环境："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:52
msgid ""
"**Clone the Repository** Clone the project from GitHub to your local "
"machine:"
msgstr "**克隆仓库** 从 GitHub 克隆项目到本地："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:59
msgid "**Install Dependencies** Install the project dependencies:"
msgstr "**安装依赖** 安装项目依赖："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:65
msgid "**Install the Plugin**"
msgstr "**安装插件**"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:70
msgid "Checkpoint"
msgstr "检查点"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:72
msgid "Run"
msgstr "运行"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:76
msgid "to confirm PyTorch is installed."
msgstr "以确认 PyTorch 已安装。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:78
msgid "Option 2: Docker Setup (no local environment required)"
msgstr "方案二：Docker 安装（无需本地环境）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:80
msgid ""
"The Docker setup builds a pre‑configured Jupyter notebook environment with "
"all dependencies (including the Kaiwu SDK) already installed."
msgstr "Docker 安装构建一个预配置的 Jupyter notebook 环境，所有依赖（包括 Kaiwu SDK）均已安装。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:82
msgid "Required Project Structure"
msgstr "所需项目结构"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:93
msgid "Docker Commands"
msgstr "Docker 命令"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:95
msgid ""
"**Clone the repository** Clone the project from GitHub to your local "
"machine:"
msgstr "**克隆仓库** 从 GitHub 克隆项目到本地："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:102
msgid "**Build the Docker image**"
msgstr "**构建 Docker 镜像**"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:107
msgid "**Start the Jupyter notebook server**"
msgstr "**启动 Jupyter notebook 服务器**"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:112
msgid "Access"
msgstr "访问方式"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:114
msgid "Open `http://localhost:8888` (no token required)"
msgstr "打开 `http://localhost:8888`（无需 token）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:115
msgid "Project root mounted at `/home/jovyan/work`"
msgstr "项目根目录挂载在 `/home/jovyan/work`"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:116
msgid "Use JupyterLab Terminal for command-line work"
msgstr "使用 JupyterLab 终端进行命令行操作"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:122
msgid ""
"This mounts your local repository into the container, so any changes you "
"make locally will be reflected immediately inside Jupyter."
msgstr "这会将您的本地仓库挂载到容器中，因此您在本地所做的任何更改都会立即反映在 Jupyter 中。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:124
msgid "Stop the Server"
msgstr "停止服务器"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:126
msgid "Press `Ctrl+C`, then run:"
msgstr "按 `Ctrl+C`，然后运行："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:131
msgid "Project Structure & Package Layout"
msgstr "项目结构与包布局"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:158
msgid "Key Code Entities"
msgstr "关键代码实体"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md
msgid "Entity"
msgstr "实体"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md
msgid "Description"
msgstr "说明"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md
msgid "**`AbstractBoltzmannMachine`**"
msgstr "**`AbstractBoltzmannMachine`**"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md
msgid "Base class defining the interface for all models"
msgstr "定义所有模型接口的基类"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md
msgid "**`BoltzmannMachine`**"
msgstr "**`BoltzmannMachine`**"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md
msgid "Fully connected; uses `condition_sample()` for positive phase"
msgstr "全连接；正相使用 `condition_sample()`"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md
msgid "**`RestrictedBoltzmannMachine`**"
msgstr "**`RestrictedBoltzmannMachine`**"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md
msgid ""
"Bipartite graph with `quadratic_coef` and `linear_bias` for custom energy "
"definition"
msgstr "带有 `quadratic_coef` 和 `linear_bias` 的二部图，用于自定义能量定义"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md
msgid "**`GaussianBernoulliRBM`**"
msgstr "**`GaussianBernoulliRBM`**"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md
msgid ""
"RBM variant with real-valued visible units (Gaussian distribution) and "
"binary hidden units (Bernoulli distribution), or vice versa"
msgstr "RBM 变体，具有实值可见单元（高斯分布）和二元隐藏单元（伯努利分布），反之亦然"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:167
msgid "Kaiwu SDK Configuration & License"
msgstr "Kaiwu SDK 配置与授权"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:169
msgid ""
"Kaiwu-PyTorch-Plugin depends on the **Kaiwu SDK** to provide quantum "
"computing capabilities. The Kaiwu SDK is a proprietary backend that provides"
" both classical simulation (SA) and quantum execution (CIM), and must be "
"installed separately."
msgstr ""
"Kaiwu-PyTorch-Plugin 依赖 **Kaiwu SDK** 提供量子计算能力。Kaiwu SDK "
"是一个专有后端，同时提供经典模拟（SA）和量子执行（CIM），必须单独安装。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:171
msgid "Step 1: Obtain & Install SDK"
msgstr "步骤 1：获取并安装 SDK"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:172
msgid "Option A: Install from PyPI (Recommended)"
msgstr "方案 A：从 PyPI 安装（推荐）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:174
msgid "The Kaiwu SDK is available on PyPI. You can install it directly:"
msgstr "Kaiwu SDK 已在 PyPI 上发布。您可以直接安装："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:180
msgid "Alternatively, add the following line to your `requirements.txt`:"
msgstr "或者，将以下行添加到您的 `requirements.txt`："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:186
msgid "Option B: Install from Official Wheel"
msgstr "方案 B：从官方 Wheel 安装"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:188
msgid ""
"If you need a specific version or have network restrictions, download the "
"SDK wheel from the QBoson platform:"
msgstr "如果您需要特定版本或有网络限制，请从 QBoson 平台下载 SDK wheel："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:190
msgid "Visit the <u>Kaiwu SDK download page</u> on the QBoson platform"
msgstr "访问 QBoson 平台上的 <u>Kaiwu SDK 下载页面</u>"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:191
msgid ""
"Download the wheel package suitable for your system (e.g., "
"`kaiwu-1.3.1-py3-none-any.whl`)"
msgstr "下载适合您系统的 wheel 包（例如 `kaiwu-1.3.1-py3-none-any.whl`）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:192
msgid "Install the wheel:"
msgstr "安装 wheel："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:198
msgid "Step 2: Set Environment Variables"
msgstr "步骤 2：设置环境变量"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:200
msgid ""
"After installation, you need to configure the SDK authorization credentials."
" Set the following environment variables:"
msgstr "安装完成后，您需要配置 SDK 授权凭证。设置以下环境变量："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:207
msgid ""
"**Important:** The environment variable name is `SDK_CODE`, **not** "
"`SDK_TOKEN`. Using the wrong variable name will cause authentication to "
"fail."
msgstr "**重要：** 环境变量名称是 `SDK_CODE`，**不是** `SDK_TOKEN`。使用错误的变量名将导致认证失败。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:209
msgid "Step 3: Initialize License in Code"
msgstr "步骤 3：在代码中初始化授权"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:211
msgid "Then initialize the license in your code:"
msgstr "然后在代码中初始化授权："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:223
msgid ""
"**Note:** Always keep credentials in environment variables, never hardcode "
"them in source code, as they could be accidentally committed to version "
"control. The credentials can be obtained from the <u>Kaiwu SDK page</u> on "
"the QBoson platform."
msgstr ""
"**注意：** 始终将凭证保存在环境变量中，切勿硬编码在源代码中，以免意外提交到版本控制。凭证可在 QBoson 平台的 <u>Kaiwu SDK "
"页面</u> 获取。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:225
msgid "Obtain Quantum Computer Access"
msgstr "获取量子计算机访问权限"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:226
msgid "How to Get QPU Access"
msgstr "如何获取 QPU 访问权限"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:227
msgid ""
"To experience true quantum computing capabilities, you need to obtain access"
" to a quantum computer:"
msgstr "要体验真正的量子计算能力，您需要获取量子计算机的访问权限："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:229
msgid "Register an account on the <u>QBoson platform</u>"
msgstr "在 <u>QBoson 平台</u> 注册账号"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:230
msgid ""
"Contact the official staff through the platform to request a quota for the "
"real quantum device"
msgstr "通过平台联系官方工作人员申请真机配额"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:232
msgid ""
"**Note:** Before obtaining access to the real quantum device, you can use "
"simulators for development and testing. The Kaiwu SDK provides various "
"classical optimizers (such as the simulated annealing optimizer) as "
"classical alternatives to the quantum sampler."
msgstr ""
"**注意：** 在获取真机访问权限之前，您可以使用模拟器进行开发和测试。Kaiwu SDK "
"提供多种经典优化器（如模拟退火优化器）作为量子采样器的经典替代方案。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:234
msgid "Development Workflow Recommendation:"
msgstr "开发工作流建议："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:253
msgid ""
"**Note:** Always validate your model with the classical simulator before "
"consuming QPU quota."
msgstr "**注意：** 在消耗 QPU 配额之前，请始终使用经典模拟器验证您的模型。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:254
msgid "Verify Installation"
msgstr "验证安装"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:256
msgid ""
"After installation, run the following code to verify that the installation "
"was successful:"
msgstr "安装完成后，运行以下代码验证安装是否成功："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:258
msgid "Three Verification Steps"
msgstr "三个验证步骤"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:260
msgid ""
"**Check versions:** Confirm PyTorch (2.x) & Kaiwu SDK (v1.3.1+) are loaded"
msgstr "**检查版本：** 确认 PyTorch（2.x）和 Kaiwu SDK（v1.3.1+）已加载"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:261
msgid "**Test SDK backend:** Verify the classical SA solver works"
msgstr "**测试 SDK 后端：** 验证经典 SA 求解器正常工作"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:262
msgid ""
"**Instantiate KPP model:** Confirm `RestrictedBoltzmannMachine` imports and "
"initializes"
msgstr "**实例化 KPP 模型：** 确认 `RestrictedBoltzmannMachine` 可导入并初始化"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:264
msgid "Smoke-Test Code"
msgstr "冒烟测试代码"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:289
msgid "Expected Output"
msgstr "预期输出"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:298
msgid ""
"If no error occurs, your environment is ready. You can now build models and "
"validate with classical samplers, then switch to the quantum sampler."
msgstr "如果没有报错，您的环境已就绪。现在可以构建模型并使用经典采样器验证，然后切换到量子采样器。"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:300
msgid "Development Environment Setup (Optional)"
msgstr "开发环境设置（可选）"

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:302
msgid ""
"If you plan to participate in the development of the plugin, you can install"
" the development dependencies:"
msgstr "如果您计划参与插件的开发，可以安装开发依赖："

#: ../../source/getting_started/installation.md:308
msgid "Run tests:"
msgstr "运行测试："

